You ain't gettin' none.

598
00:50:53.349 --> 00:50:56.619
Fuck that guy.

599
00:50:56.619 --> 00:50:58.755
Fucking guys
in this town. Here.

600
00:51:00.755 --> 00:51:02.360
Oh, come on.
Really?

601
